      "message": "Hmm, STArray does determine a max. capacity and die if we attempt to go beyond it. We also only perform an SkASSERT within the ganesh equivalent of this class. It is supremely unlikely we would ever encounter that use case anyhow, but it\u0027s better to be 100% sure \u0026 safe.\n\nI removed the `maxVertexAttributes` parameter and instead now perform this check within `VulkanGraphicsPipeline::Make`, returning a nullptr if we violate this limit (which has a TODO to be handled appropriately upstream within graphite https://skia.googlesource.com/skia.git/+/refs/heads/main/src/gpu/graphite/ResourceProvider.cpp#57).",
